# Raw vendor market data used to BUILD DayTrader/data/days.js.
# Deliberately not published: these files name the real tickers and dates, which
# defeats the anonymisation the sim depends on. tools/build_data.py refetches
# them if you ever need to rebuild. The built, rebased days.js IS committed, so
# the simulator runs without them.
DayTrader/tools/*.json

.DS_Store
*.log
